ax-w-3xl\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The first text someone receives in the morning sets the emotional tone for their entire day. Make yours count with our collection of original, heartfelt, funny, and deeply romantic good morning messages.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"article\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-white border border-[#d4c3ab] rounded-[32px] p-6 md:p-10 shadow-sm\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Why Good Morning Messages Matter in a Relationship\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Research in relationship psychology consistently finds that small, frequent positive interactions — rather than grand gestures — are the building blocks of long-term relationship satisfaction. A good morning message is exactly that: a small, consistent act of love that says \\\\\\\"You are my first thought today.\\\\\\\"\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"For long-distance couples especially, a morning text is often the most intimate daily touchpoint. It bridges the physical gap and keeps the emotional connection alive across any distance.\\\"}],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"Sweet \\u0026 Romantic\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 flex items-center gap-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"💕\\\"}],\\\" \\\",\\\"Sweet \\u0026 Romantic\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 mt-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Good morning! I woke up thinking about you. Now you\\u0026apos;re all I can think about. Basically, you\\u0026apos;ve ruined my productivity for the day and I\\u0026apos;m completely fine with it.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Rise and shine, beautiful. The world is a little brighter because you\\u0026apos;re in it.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"I hope you woke up as warm and loved as you make me feel every single day. Good morning.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Mornings are my favourite because they remind me I get another whole day with you in my life.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"You are literally my first thought every morning. And my last thought every night. And most thoughts in between. Good morning.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Good morning to the person who gave my life a soundtrack.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"6\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Every morning I get to wake up knowing you exist and that somehow we found each other. That is a miracle I will never take for granted.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"7\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"I was going to send you a good morning text, but then I realised no words are good enough for how I feel about you. So here is this text instead.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"Funny \\u0026 Playful\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 flex items-center gap-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"😄\\\"}],\\\" \\\",\\\"Funny \\u0026 Playful\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 mt-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Good morning! Just a friendly reminder that I like you a lot and you should probably text back.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Rise and shine! Or keep sleeping, honestly, you look cute either way. Not that I can see you right now. This is not weird.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Good morning! I was going to start today being productive, then I thought about you and now I am just smiling at my phone like an idiot.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Morning! I hope your day is as good as your smile makes my heart feel. That means excellent, by the way.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Good morning from the person who thinks about you way too much. Have a great day and please do not use this information against me.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"For Long-Distance Couples\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 flex items-center gap-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"🌍\\\"}],\\\" \\\",\\\"For Long-Distance Couples\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 mt-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Good morning from my corner of the world to yours. The distance is temporary. The love is permanent.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"I woke up today wishing you were next to me. One day you will be. Until then, good morning from someone who misses you more than words can say.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Wherever you are, whatever time it is there — know that someone is thinking of you right now and smiling.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"The most bittersweet part of my morning is knowing you are waking up to a completely different sunrise. One day we will share one. Good morning.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Miles apart, hearts together. Good morning to the person worth every bit of the wait.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"Casual \\u0026 Everyday\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 flex items-center gap-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"☕\\\"}],\\\" \\\",\\\"Casual \\u0026 Everyday\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 mt-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Good morning! Hope your coffee is hot and your day is kind.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Hey you. Good morning. Just checking in. No reason. Okay, the reason is that I like you.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Morning! I thought about sending something profound but really I just wanted you to know I\\u0026apos;m thinking of you.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Good morning! Today will be a great day because somewhere in it, you exist.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"Rise and shine! Or rise and take your time. Either is valid. Good morning.\\\\\\\"\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"className\\\":